WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.278
GCB learns two encoders together.

00:00:02.358 --> 00:00:08.710
Phi encodes a state-goal pair so its L1 distance
matches an on-policy bisimulation metric,

00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:11.783
capturing how differently two tasks behave.

00:00:11.863 --> 00:00:17.428
Psi encodes a state so the goal embedding minus the
state embedding equals phi.

00:00:17.508 --> 00:00:22.073
That makes goals composable: add an analogous pair
to your state,

00:00:22.153 --> 00:00:25.217
then take the nearest neighbor in psi space.

00:00:25.297 --> 00:00:28.290
Training is offline on Implicit Q-Learning.
